message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata provided here."
type: software
title: "gdelt-regkg"
version: 2.1.1
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A Python library for reconstructing GDELT Global Knowledge Graph
  (GKG) records from article text and metadata. It supports the
  generation of complete GKG records and the extraction of individual
  fields, including themes, entities, locations, counts, tone, and
  other structured information. The library can be used to reconstruct
  gaps in GKG coverage and process custom news datasets.
